{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Contact · {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
<style>
:root{--bg1:#f6fff4;--bg2:#e9fbff;--accent:#3b8b6f;--muted:#54606a;--card:#ffffff}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));
  color: #0b2436;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
  background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg'), linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));
  background-repeat:repeat;
}
.container{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}
.header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd6a5,#bfe9d7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#073b2b}
.nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start;margin-top:18px}
.card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(11,36,54,0.08)}
.h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#062b22}
.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
.contact-form label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#25423a}
.input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6f2ed;background:#fbfffe}
.row{display:flex;gap:12px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#2f9a6a);color:white;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.small-muted{font-size:12px;color:#5b6c6a;margin-top:8px}
.section{margin-top:22px}
.social-proof{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pulse{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff7e8,#e9fffb);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eef7f3}
.benefits-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
.process-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
.process-list li{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #ecf6f3}
.faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:10px}
.lead-magnet{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#f7fffb);border:1px solid #eaf7ef}
.footer{margin-top:28px;padding:18px 0;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
svg.decor{opacity:0.12;position:absolute;right:30px;top:120px;width:320px;height:320px}
@media(max-width:880px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .container{padding:18px;margin:14px}
  svg.decor{display:none}
  .benefits-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<header class="header">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">HM</div>
    <div>
      <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary">
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="services.html">Our Services</a>
    <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
    <a href="approach.html">How We Work</a>
    <a href="pricing.html">Fees</a>
    <a href="about.html">Team</a>
    <a href="book.html">Book</a>
    <a href="contact.html" style="font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <div class="card">
      <h1 class="h1">Connect with a Whole-Person Clinician</h1>
      <p class="lead">Schedule a consultation to explore lifestyle, nutrition, preventive testing and personalized strategies. We blend evidence-informed therapies with gentle, patient-led care—offered both in-clinic and virtually.</p>
      <div class="section social-proof">
        <div class="pulse">
          <strong>4.9</strong> — Excellent care, attentive and practical. <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">— Patient review</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pulse">
          <strong>Trusted</strong> by local employers and wellness groups. <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">— Community partners</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">What we help with</h3>
        <div class="benefits-grid">
          <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfff9)">
            <strong>Stress & Resilience</strong>
            <div class="small-muted">Tools for nervous system regulation, mindfulness and sleep hygiene.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f9fff9)">
            <strong>Gut & Digestion</strong>
            <div class="small-muted">Nutrition-focused support and educational testing options.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff8ff)">
            <strong>Energy & Vitality</strong>
            <div class="small-muted">Lifestyle, movement and targeted supplements as appropriate.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7fffe)">
            <strong>Inflammation & Chronic Symptoms</strong>
            <div class="small-muted">Holistic strategies for reducing symptom burden; no guarantees implied.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">How the first visit flows</h3>
        <ol class="process-list">
          <li>Intake & health history review (60–75 minutes)</li>
          <li>Collaborative goal setting and initial plan</li>
          <li>Optional labs explained and arranged as educational tools</li>
          <li>Follow-up schedule and referrals as needed</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside>
    <div class="card contact-form" aria-labelledby="contactHeading">
      <h2 id="contactHeading" style="margin-top:0">Request an appointment</h2>
      <form id="contact" novalidate>
        <label for="name">Full name</label>
        <input id="name" name="name" class="input" required placeholder="Your full name">

        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" class="input" required placeholder="{{EMAIL}}">

        <div class="row">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label for="phone">Phone</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" class="input" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
          </div>
          <div style="width:140px">
            <label for="type">Visit type</label>
            <select id="type" name="type" class="input">
              <option>Virtual</option>
              <option>In-person</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <label for="message">Brief reason for visit</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="e.g., sleep changes, digestive concerns, energy" class="input"></textarea>

        <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;margin-top:10px">
          <input type="checkbox" id="consent" required style="margin-right:8px">
          I consent to receive communications and understand this is educational and not a guaranteed cure.
        </label>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
          <button class="btn" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
          <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" class="small-muted" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)">Or call us: {{PHONE}}</a>
        </div>

        <div id="formMsg" class="small-muted" style="display:none;margin-top:8px"></div>
      </form>

      <div class="small-muted section">
        Appointments are available both in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and by telehealth. Insurance coverage varies; we can provide superbills on request.
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>

<svg class="decor" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
  <defs>
    <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
      <stop offset="0" stop-color="#bdeadf"/>
      <stop offset="1" stop-color="#f6fbdc"/>
    </linearGradient>
  </defs>
  <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="60" fill="url(#g)"/>
  <g fill="#fff" opacity="0.9">
    <rect x="100" y="20" width="80" height="6" rx="3"/>
    <rect x="100" y="36" width="60" height="6" rx="3"/>
  </g>
</svg>

<section class="card section">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0">Frequently asked questions</h3>
  <dl class="faq">
    <dt>How do I book?</dt>
    <dd>Use the form, call {{PHONE}} or click the booking button. We'll follow up to confirm details.</dd>
    <dt>Do you accept insurance?</dt>
    <dd>We are an out-of-network provider for many plans; we can provide documentation for reimbursement. Check with your insurer.</dd>
    <dt>Are labs required?</dt>
    <dd>Labs are optional and used as educational tools to inform care when appropriate.</dd>
    <dt>Is telehealth available?</dt>
    <dd>Yes—virtual visits are offered. We'll help you prepare for a productive remote visit.</dd>
  </dl>
</section>

<section class="card section">
  <div class="lead-magnet">
    <div>
      <strong>Free guide:</strong> 5 foundational steps to better sleep and energy.
      <div class="small-muted">Download practical, evidence-informed tips you can start today.</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?download=guide">Download PDF</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card section">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0">Final steps</h3>
  <p class="small-muted">We prioritize education and whole-person planning. No promises of cures—just collaborative care rooted in clinical evidence and patient goals.</p>
  <div style="margin-top:12px">
    <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" class="small-muted" style="margin-left:12px;text-decoration:none">Email: {{EMAIL}}</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>
  <div><a href="privacy.html" class="small-muted" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)">Privacy</a></div>
</footer>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  var form = document.getElementById('contact');
  var msg = document.getElementById('formMsg');
  form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
    e.preventDefault();
    var name = form.name.value.trim();
    var email = form.email.value.trim();
    var consent = form.consent.checked;
    if(!name || !email || !consent){
      msg.style.display='block';
      msg.textContent = 'Please complete name, email, and consent to proceed.';
      return;
    }
    msg.style.display='block';
    msg.textContent = 'Thanks—sending request...';
    var params = new URLSearchParams(new FormData(form));
    if ("{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}") {
      // attempt to open booking URL with query params
      window.location.href = "{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?"+params.toString();
    } else {
      window.location.href = "mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=Request from "+encodeURIComponent(name)+"&body="+encodeURIComponent(params.toString());
    }
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk: contact page for the holistic_medicine site (layoutFamily: bold_playful, voiceFamily: clinical_calm).

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — a self-contained contact and appointment page. The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for a tiled SVG background pattern (please add a unique pattern.svg there).

Placeholders to replace before publishing:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{CREDENTIALS}}

Editing notes:
- Replace placeholders with your templating or deployment tool.
- The contact form uses a simple client-side routine: on submit it redirects to PRIMARY_CTA_URL with query parameters if that placeholder is present; otherwise it opens a mailto to EMAIL. Update the inline <script> in contact.html to hook into your API endpoint or server-side form handler.
- CSS lives in the top <style> block. Adjust color variables (--accent, --bg1, --bg2, --muted) to fit brand colors.

Accessibility & content guidance:
- Form fields have labels and required attributes. The color palette aims for readable contrast but should be tested with your exact brand values.
- Content follows holistic/integrative medicine guidelines: emphasis on education, whole-person planning, optional labs; explicit avoidance of guaranteed cures or definitive promises.
- If you create a separate conditions page, include common concerns such as stress, sleep, digestion, inflammation and energy, and add a clear disclaimer about individualized care and no guaranteed cures.

Assets:
- Add a unique SVG at assets/img/pattern.svg. The page uses that file for tiled background texture; do not rely on external fonts or CDNs.

Deployment:
- Place contact.html alongside the other site pages (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html).
- Verify links in the navigation and ensure PRIMARY_CTA_URL points to your booking flow or booking provider.

Support:
- For visual edits, change the CSS variables and styles in the <style> block.
- For behavior, update the inline JavaScript in contact.html to send form submissions to your server or a third-party form processing service.

License: MIT (placeholder)."} 
BUNDLE_END
